  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to strengthening national laboratories to be ready for pandemics</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen Kazakhstan&#x2019;s preparedness for infectious disease outbreaks by modernizing essential laboratory infrastructure and improving surveillance capacity subregional laboratories. In partnership with the World Health Organization (WHO), the project will support the reconstruction of NPCSEM&#x2019;s national reference laboratories in Almaty and the construction and equipping of a new virology laboratory in Turkestan &#x2014; a high-density region that currently lacks dedicated laboratory</narrative>
  </description>
